      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15828/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll into balls about 1 to 1 ½ inches in diameter. Roll balls in any excess baking mix to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/otr6fgpb_v6GO9lDZTyO_QPEWVQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15828-one-two-three-sausage-balls-VAT-step-03-72e64139b6b94b30b79d33fb9ff51a2b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15828/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place on a nonstick baking sheet and bake in the preheated oven until golden brown and cooked through, about 18 to 22 minutes.",
